What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../battery_temp_status
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../battery_presence_status
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read-only hexadecimal raw battery-info status bytes, at offsets
		0x06 and 0x07 respectively. These are individual register reads,
		not an atomic snapshot. Their interpretation for PM8150B Gen4
		has not been validated on hardware; they do not prove that the
		battery temperature is valid, fresh, or protected.

